## Execution
Runs: batch
Expected wall time: well under a minute of compute (6 samples, a few tens of thousands of
genes), plus scheduler queue time. Output size: under 1 MB in total. The `batch` default is
kept; login-node execution was not requested. Submitted through
`_system/executorlib.py submit`.
